OL,3,GNEWSA'We'll dust ourselves down' after
OL,4,Aculture snub
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP says missing out on UK City of
OL,7,FCulture 2029 is disappointing, but
OL,8,Fadded: "We've just got to dust
OL,9,Fourselves down because, quite frankly,
OL,10,Fwe're going to do this anyway."
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough was on a nine-strong
OL,13,Flonglist, but failed to make the
OL,14,Fshortlist which would have unlocked
OL,15,Ffurther funding and put them in line
OL,16,Ffor a #10m prize.
OL,18,FLabour MP Andy McDonald said the area
OL,19,Fwas a "cultural powerhouse" and that
OL,20,Ftheir bid for City of Culture had been
OL,21,Fbold and compelling.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
